# Enforce LF line endings repo-wide. The repo mandates LF (.editorconfig end_of_line=lf,
# Prettier endOfLine=lf, pre-commit mixed-line-ending --fix=lf); without this, Windows
# checkouts get CRLF and `prettier --check` / `make` break. Binaries are marked so Git
# leaves them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.pfx   binary
*.p12   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
